# API Endpoints

## Public (No Auth)

```
GET  /health          Liveness/readiness
GET  /metrics          Prometheus metrics
GET  /info            Engine identity + flags
```

## Devtools (disabled in prod by default — EVIL_DEVTOOLS_ENABLED)

```
GET  /                Swagger UI
GET  /api/openapi     OpenAPI 3.x spec (also via EVIL_EXPOSE_OPENAPI_SPEC)
GET  /admin/graphiql  Playground with example tabs
```

## Authenticated (JWT Bearer)

### Process Catalog

```
GET    /processes                         List deployed processes
GET    /processes/{model_id}                   Process metadata (?includeXml)
GET    /processes/{model_id}/versions          Version history (?includeXml)
POST   /processes                         Deploy BPMN (JSON: {"sources": [...]})
POST   /processes/{model_id}/start             Start new PI
PUT    /processes/{model_id}/enable            Enable process (204)
PUT    /processes/{model_id}/disable           Disable process (204)
DELETE /processes/{model_id}                   Undeploy process (204)
DELETE /processes/{model_id}/versions/{ver}    Delete version (204)
```

### User Tasks

```
PUT    /user-tasks/{fniId}/finish         Complete with result (204)
PUT    /user-tasks/{fniId}/cancel         Cancel + abort PI (204)
```

### Process Instances

```
PUT    /process-instances/{id}/abort      Abort running PI (204)
DELETE /process-instances/{id}            Delete terminal PI (204)
```

### Observability

```
GET    /stats                             Engine snapshot
```

## GraphQL

```
POST   /api/v1/graphql                    Queries (Ash-generated)
```

## WebSocket

```
ws://host:port/socket                    Phoenix Channels
Topics: engine:events | pi:<id>
```
